  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "結構矩陣分析",
    "sub_ename": "ANALYSIS OF MATRIX STRUCTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程教導學生了解結構分析的基本觀念、能量法的原理與觀念及應用矩陣的觀念包括能量法、矩陣力法、有限元素力法、矩陣位法、有限元素位法及直接勁度法來分析結構。",
    "describe_eh": "Focus on the fundamental concept of structure analysis as well as the principle and concept of energy. Make the students know more about structure matrix and analyze the structure with the concept of matrix (including energy method, matrix force method, finite element force method, matrix displacement method, finite element displacement method and direct stiffness method).",
